          "key": "implementation_controls",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Implementation and communication controls",
          "items": [
            "Stage and verify approved materials, tooling, labels, and inspection devices",
            "Set process parameters and record independently checked values",
            "Run controlled first-piece or trial output and capture acceptance evidence",
            "Resolve alarms, defects, deviations, or unresolved readiness conditions",
            "Authorize startup and hand off released settings and next check to the crew",
            "Document, procedure, software, tooling, or system changes are controlled",
            "Affected personnel receive the approved change before independent work",
            "Implementation evidence shows the action was completed as approved",
            "Temporary controls have an owner and defined removal condition"
          ]
